{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20261arIMb6SJw1793461674.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>政府預計今晚及明晚是新皇崗口岸過關高峰，新皇崗口岸現時過關北上的人流不算多，大部分過關通道都有開。有旅客稱為免太多人，所以提早過關。</p><p></p><p>今晚深圳灣口岸亦會延長通關至明日凌晨兩點，相關口岸的公共交通服務會加強。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:35.093910+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T15:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.797689+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.140484+00:00","content_hash":"53c8c707a41d6bc9dd3f45dd8ae29bdda148961b786e89a1662a9ddfab296f05","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:35.093910+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}